WEBVTT

00:18:29.521 --> 00:18:33.298
when we're able to transform
Bakers into bakers.

00:18:35.116 --> 00:18:37.259
The memory palace,
these memory techniques --

00:18:37.283 --> 00:18:38.695
they're just shortcuts.

00:18:38.719 --> 00:18:41.279
In fact, they're not
even really shortcuts.

00:18:41.684 --> 00:18:44.199
They work because they make you work.

00:18:45.017 --> 00:18:48.259
They force a kind of depth of processing,

00:18:48.283 --> 00:18:49.780
a kind of mindfulness,

00:18:49.804 --> 00:18:53.684
that most of us don't normally
walk around exercising.

00:18:54.494 --> 00:18:56.295
But there actually are no shortcuts.

00:18:57.248 --> 00:18:59.280
This is how stuff is made memorable.